data.content:
## What Changed (Microsoft.OpenApi v1 → v2 in .NET 10)

The `Microsoft.AspNetCore.OpenApi` 10.0 package upgraded to **Microsoft.OpenApi v2**, which targets OpenAPI 3.1. Key breaking changes affecting your code:

### 1. `OpenApiAny` types removed
`OpenApiString`, `OpenApiInteger`, etc. are gone. `Example` is now a `JsonNode`.

### 2. `OpenApiReference` / `ReferenceType` restructured
Type-specific reference classes replace the generic `OpenApiReference` + `ReferenceType` enum pattern.

### 3. `Nullable` property removed from schemas
OpenAPI 3.1 expresses nullability via the `type` keyword (a flags enum `JsonSchemaType`), not a boolean.

---

## Fixed Code

```csharp
using System.Text.Json.Nodes;          // replaces Microsoft.OpenApi.Any
using Microsoft.OpenApi.Models;
using Microsoft.OpenApi.Models.References; // new reference types

options.AddOperationTransformer((operation, context, ct) =>
{
    var param = operation.Parameters.FirstOrDefault(p => p.Name == "api-version");
    if (param is not null)
    {
        // JsonNode replaces OpenApiString
        param.Schema.Example = JsonValue.Create("1.0");
    }

    operation.Responses.TryAdd("401", new OpenApiResponse { Description = "Unauthorized" });

    // Use OpenApiSecuritySchemeReference instead of OpenApiSecurityScheme + OpenApiReference
    var oAuthScheme = new OpenApiSecuritySchemeReference("oauth2");
    operation.Security = new List<OpenApiSecurityRequirement>
    {
        new() { [oAuthScheme] = scopes }
    };

    return Task.CompletedTask;
});

options.AddSchemaTransformer((schema, context, ct) =>
{
    if (schema.Properties is not null)
    {
        foreach (var property in schema.Properties)
        {
            if (schema.Required?.Contains(property.Key) != true)
            {
                // Remove Null from the type flags instead of setting Nullable = false
                property.Value.Type &= ~JsonSchemaType.Null;
            }
        }
    }
    return Task.CompletedTask;
});
```

### Summary of replacements

| .NET 9 (OpenApi v1) | .NET 10 (OpenApi v2) |
|---|---|
| `new OpenApiString("1.0")` | `JsonValue.Create("1.0")` |
| `using Microsoft.OpenApi.Any` | `using System.Text.Json.Nodes` |
| `OpenApiSecurityScheme { Reference = new OpenApiReference { Type = ReferenceType.SecurityScheme, Id = "oauth2" } }` | `new OpenApiSecuritySchemeReference("oauth2")` |
| `property.Nullable = false` | `property.Type &= ~JsonSchemaType.Null` |
